848 0 obj
<<
/A 2444 0 R
/Alt (Panel A displays a donut chart showing the distribution of drug-drug interaction \(DDI\) severity scores among 2,148 records, with 54.9 percent classified as severe, 43.5 percent as moderate, 1.4 percent as none, and 0.1 percent as most severe. An accompanying table details DDI severity scores and the percentage of patients affected. Panel B contains a horizontal bar chart and table summarizing the number and percentage of records for eight interaction types, with metabolic interactions most common at 41.6 percent, followed by toxicity overlap at 18.4 percent. Panel C features a clustered bar chart showing the percentage of patients exposed to potential hepatotoxicity, neuropathy, thrombosis risk, nephrotoxicity, and cardiotoxicity pDDIs. Panel D presents a bar chart depicting the near-universal rate of patients with at least two potential severe interaction flags across five cancer types, with all groups above 92 percent.)
/K [37 2445 0 R]
/P 174 0 R
/Pg 57 0 R
/S /Figure
/T (FIGURE 3)
/Type /StructElem
>>
endobj
